/* Whole controller step, with all lift state kept in registers for the
   1001 iterations (same logic as lift_ctrl_get_vals / lift_ctrl_loop /
   lift_ctrl_set_vals, written back to the globals at the end).  The
   set_vals bit packing and the LED decode are branch-free. */
